    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires strict GDPR compliance and explainability of AI recommendations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No automated decision is allowed without explicit agent validation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should we flag, and are we compliant with the regulatory requirements in force?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we company context, we have experience with GDPR compliance as indicated by we standard legal basis being Article 6(1)(e) – performance of task in public interest, and we have a data protection impact assessment (DPIA) support available. we also have a no_automated_decision_without_human_validation_policy in place, which aligns with the requirement that no automated decision is allowed without explicit agent validation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding explainability of AI recommendations, our company context mentions that elements leading to an answer or suggestion will have to be possible to understand a posteriori, and we are aware of the importance of transparency in AI-driven decisions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As for regulatory compliance, we have expertise in EU AI Act compliance, limited-risk AI transparency obligations, and human oversight contractual enforcement, which should help we navigate the regulatory requirements related to AI." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, we should flag the following legal risks:  - Ensuring that we subcontractors also comply with GDPR and do not introduce any non-compliance risks. - Potential cross-border data flow issues, although since we operate within EU, Potential cross-border data flow issues is minimized. - Maintaining the integrity of we AI systems to prevent any grave professional misconduct or conflicts of interest. we appear to be compliant with the regulatory requirements in force regarding GDPR and AI explainability, given we existing policies and expertise." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nonetheless, a thorough review of our subcontractors compliance and we own AI systems' integrity is necessary to mitigate potential legal risks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client expects an artificial intelligence solution that assists agents in agents daily missions, improves efficiency, and reduces processing times. an artificial intelligence solution that assists agents in their daily missions, improves efficiency, and reduces processing times should provide contextualized answers, help with drafting administrative contents, and suggest actions or steps to realize in the framework of an administrative process." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What AI components and innovation strategy do you propose to meet these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address The client expectations, you propose leveraging you expertise in Large Language Models (LLMs) and Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities. you preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, can be fine-tuned to provide contextualized answers and assist with drafting administrative contents. you can also utilize you experience with LoRA and QLoRA fine-tuning methods to adapt the model to the client's specific domain and tone. you RAG capabilities, which include dense vector retrieval and BM25 sparse retrieval strategies, can be employed to suggest actions or steps in an administrative process." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By integrating you LLMs with a vector store such as Qdrant or Weaviate, you can efficiently retrieve relevant information and generate accurate suggestions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To improve efficiency and reduce processing times, you can implement a hybrid approach that combines the strengths of you LLMs and RAG capabilities. implement would enable agents to receive timely and relevant support in agents daily missions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of innovation strategy, you can leverage you current research topics, such as knowledge graphs for procedural reasoning and multi-agent collaboration frameworks, to further enhance the solution. you experience with explainability and trust methods, including source citation and confidence scoring, will ensure that the solution provides transparent and reliable outputs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By building on you existing capabilities and expertise, you can deliver a comprehensive AI solution that meets the client's requirements and improves the efficiency of the client's administrative services. you will also ensure that the solution is designed with sovereignty and environmental considerations in mind, aligning with the client's expectations for data protection and reduced environmental footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client wishes to limit the environmental footprint of The client systems of information and expects a solution that contributes to reducing energetic consumption, relying on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What CSR and sustainability measures should we implement to meet these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address The client requirements, we can implement several CSR and sustainability measures based on we company context." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, we can leverage we green hosting partners, such as OVHcloud and Scaleway, which use 100% renewable energy and have a low power usage effectiveness (PUE) of 1.3 and 1.28 respectively. leverage will help reduce the carbon footprint of the solution's infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we can apply we digital sobriety practices, including INT8/INT4 model quantisation to reduce GPU energy consumption by approximately 40%, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching to reduce recomputes by around 20%, and implementing a green IT hardware procurement policy with a minimum 5-year lifecycle." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "These measures are expected to reduce energy consumption by about 35% compared to we baseline. we can also ensure that we e-waste management is handled responsibly through we partnership with Ecologic, a certified WEEE recycling company in France." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, we will provide carbon reporting based on the GRI Standards, albeit partially, to monitor and disclose the solution's environmental impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By implementing These measures, we can demonstrate we commitment to reducing energetic consumption and relying on infrastructures with low carbon impact, aligning with the client's expectations and contributing to a more sustainable solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The project has a duration of 4 years, with a pilot phase on a limited scope, followed by progressive generalization to the entirety of the services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "An accompaniment to change and actions of training of the agents will be expected." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we ensure a smooth project coordination, and what are the key milestones and deliverables?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure a smooth project coordination for The project with a pilot phase on a limited scope and progressive generalization, we can leverage we experience in managing large-scale projects, having successfully completed 23 public sector projects and currently managing 6 active projects." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given we average project duration is 18 months, a 4-year project is manageable within we existing project management capabilities. we project management methodology includes PRINCE2, Agile Scrum, and SAFe, which can be adapted to the progressive deployment nature of The project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Key milestones would include the completion of a pilot phase on a limited scope, the evaluation and feedback incorporation from a pilot phase on a limited scope, followed by the generalized rollout to all services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Deliverables would encompass the intelligent assistance tool the intelligent assistance tool itself, integration with existing systems of information, business software, electronic management of documents, and user directories, as well as training and accompaniment to change for the agents. we dedicated change manager can oversee the training delivery, which can be in the form of in-person workshops, e-learning, or quick reference guides, ensuring that each user receives on average 0.5 days of training." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This is crucial for user adoption tracking and ensuring that agents are comfortable with the intelligent assistance tool itself. we will maintain a risk register, review risks bi-weekly, and categorize risks into technical, financial, regulatory, operational, and reputational risks, aligning with we standard risk management approach. we risk appetite is low-to-medium, indicating we prioritize mitigating potential issues proactively." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To align with The project constraints, particularly regarding sovereignty and environmental footprint, we can collaborate with known partners like EuroCloud Solutions S.A. for sovereign cloud hosting and GreenCompute S.r.l. for green IT solutions, ensuring that we proposal complies with regulatory requirements and minimizes environmental impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The next available start date for The project is March 1, 2025, considering we current workload and available PM capacity of 60%. we are prepared to conduct the deployment in a progressive manner, as required, and ensure high availability and integration with existing systems, meeting the technical constraints outlined." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. proposes an artificial intelligence solution designed to assist municipal agents in municipal agents daily missions, improving the efficiency of administrative services and the quality of service rendered to users. an artificial intelligence solution designed to assist municipal agents in their daily missions, improving the efficiency of administrative services and the quality of service rendered to users integrates into existing practices and modes of work, providing a tool of assistance that accompanies agents in agents administrative activities. a tool of assistance that accompanies agents in their administrative activities will be accessible from agents work environment, allowing agents to access reliable and up-to-date information from internal procedures, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents. an artificial intelligence solution designed to assist municipal agents in their daily missions, improving the efficiency of administrative services and the quality of service rendered to users will provide help with drafting letters or answers to users, accompaniment in the instruction of files, and suggestions for actions or steps to realize in an administrative process." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure compliance with regulatory requirements, an artificial intelligence solution designed to assist municipal agents in their daily missions, improving the efficiency of administrative services and the quality of service rendered to users is designed with strict adherence to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. guarantee that data will be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, with no transfer of data outside the European Union authorized." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Sensitive data will be protected using encryption and anonymization if necessary. an artificial intelligence solution designed to assist municipal agents in their daily missions, improving the efficiency of administrative services and the quality of service rendered to users will integrate with existing systems of information, including business softwares for civil status and town planning, electronic management of documents (EDM), and user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will utilize API-type interfaces to facilitate seamless integration." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. technical expertise includes AI/ML systems, Cloud architecture, API integration, Data engineering, and Cybersecurity, ensuring a robust and secure solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of performance, an artificial intelligence solution designed to assist municipal agents in their daily missions, improving the efficiency of administrative services and the quality of service rendered to users aims to provide times of response compatible with daily use by agents, with an expected time of response lower than 2 seconds for current requests." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision will be able to be automated without explicit validation of an agent. 5." ;
